  "card": "Wallet transaction funding (`fundrawtransaction`) fails to enforce custom `max_tx_weight` limits when preset inputs alone satisfy the target amount. Because coin selection exits early, the wallet's final weight check previously verified against the standard 400,000 WU network limit instead of the user-provided maximum. This change checks against the configured maximum weight in the final guard and adds regression tests.",
